Subject: [PATCH] docs(readme): breakdowns are never added into the token
 counters (pr/80)

total_usage.breakdowns sums them class by class (pr/27), so 'any total'
overstated. The input/output/cache counters never include them. The
claim:readme-breakdowns-never-added record is now pass, citing
test_total_usage_breakdowns_round_trip and the goldens accounting test.
