From 553a21364d9e5bc71560ac535dc436ff05aed857 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:34:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] build: declare rust-version 1.94 for the workspace; README
 says Rust 1.94+ (pr/80)

The README said 1.85+, but rust-toolchain.toml pins 1.94.0, nothing built on
1.85, and no rust-version was declared. [workspace.package] now sets
rust-version = "1.94" and every member inherits it. The workspace checks
on rustc 1.94.1 with the develop and verify features. claim:readme-rust-185
is now pass.
